{
  "name": "MaxVideoAI - Brief to approved generation",
  "tags": [],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "brief-template-guide",
      "name": "Template guide: brief to approved generation",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -1040,
        -1240
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 1,
        "width": 940,
        "height": 820,
        "content": "# Turn a brief into an approved generation\n\n## Intended user and outcome\nFor producers and creative teams using self-hosted n8n, this template turns a structured creative brief into model recommendations, a project budget, an exact MaxVideoAI quote, one human-approved generation, and a recoverable library result.\n\n### How it works\n1. Brief Input receives `recommendationRequest`, `projectBudgetRequest`, and `generationRequest`.\n2. Deterministic MCP Client nodes list and recommend models, calculate the budget, and call `prepare_generation`.\n3. Human Approval pauses on the exact fresh quote. The workflow proceeds only when the POST body contains `approved: true` and the matching `quoteId`; rejection performs no generation.\n4. `confirm_generation` runs once. Bounded status recovery honors the returned `retry.afterSeconds` and `retry.arguments` for the accepted `jobId`. A null, invalid or mismatched retry stops polling; at most 20 status calls run. Terminal responses reach presentation and stopped jobs remain recoverable. Recovery never loops back to confirmation.\n\n### Setup\nImport this disabled workflow into a self-hosted n8n instance. After import, create a MaxVideoAI MCP OAuth credential for `https://api.maxvideoai.com/mcp`, complete OAuth in the owner-approved account, and attach that credential to every MCP Client node. Supply the three strict-schema request objects at Brief Input and test the read-only path before preparing a quote. Keep secrets and credential references out of exported JSON.\n\n## Approval and supported scope\nShow the exact current quote to a human and obtain explicit approval for that amount before resuming the webhook. A changed or expired quote requires a fresh prepare-and-approve cycle. This revision passed deterministic recovery checks in self-hosted n8n 2.38.7 using simulated MCP responses; live OAuth and paid generation were not repeated. n8n Cloud and AI Agent use through MCP Client Tool are explicitly unsupported by this template and are outside the public compatibility claim."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "brief-prepare-note",
      "name": "Step 1: prepare a fresh quote",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -1040,
        -300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1600,
        "height": 740,
        "content": "## 1. Brief, models, budget and quote\n\nBrief Input feeds `recommend_models` and `calculate_project_budget`; `prepare_generation` returns a fresh exact quote without spending credits."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "brief-approval-note",
      "name": "Step 2: require exact human approval",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        640,
        -300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 780,
        "height": 740,
        "content": "## 2. Human approval is the spending gate\n\nHuman Approval pauses for a person to approve the exact quote. Only `approved: true` with the matching `quoteId` passes; rejection starts no generation."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "brief-recovery-note",
      "name": "Step 3: confirm once and recover by job ID",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1500,
        -300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 2000,
        "height": 1060,
        "content": "## 3. One confirmation, bounded recovery\n\nAfter approval, confirm_generation runs once. Normalize Retry Fields adapts retry data for n8n expressions. Recovery follows its delay and same jobId, stopping after 20 status calls or null/invalid retry. It never repeats confirmation."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "brief-trigger",
      "name": "Brief Input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "position": [
        -980,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {},
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "brief-normalize",
      "name": "Normalize Brief",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [
        -720,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "recommendation-request",
              "name": "recommendationRequest",
              "type": "object",
              "value": "={{ $json.recommendationRequest }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "budget-request",
              "name": "projectBudgetRequest",
              "type": "object",
              "value": "={{ $json.projectBudgetRequest }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "generation-request",
              "name": "generationRequest",
              "type": "object",
              "value": "={{ $json.generationRequest }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
    {
      "id": "brief-models",
      "name": "List Models",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.mcpClient",
      "position": [
        -460,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "tool": {
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "list_models"
        },
        "inputMode": "json",
        "jsonInput": "={{ JSON.stringify({ surface: $('Normalize Brief').item.json.recommendationRequest.surface || 'video' }) }}",
        "endpointUrl": "https://api.maxvideoai.com/mcp",
        "authentication": "mcpOAuth2Api",
        "serverTransport": "httpStreamable"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "brief-recommend",
      "name": "Recommend Models",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.mcpClient",
      "position": [
        -200,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "tool": {
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "recommend_models"
        },
        "inputMode": "json",
        "jsonInput": "={{ JSON.stringify($('Normalize Brief').item.json.recommendationRequest) }}",
        "endpointUrl": "https://api.maxvideoai.com/mcp",
        "authentication": "mcpOAuth2Api",
        "serverTransport": "httpStreamable"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "brief-budget",
      "name": "Calculate Project Budget",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.mcpClient",
      "position": [
        60,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "tool": {
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "calculate_project_budget"
        },
        "inputMode": "json",
        "jsonInput": "={{ JSON.stringify($('Normalize Brief').item.json.projectBudgetRequest) }}",
        "endpointUrl": "https://api.maxvideoai.com/mcp",
        "authentication": "mcpOAuth2Api",
        "serverTransport": "httpStreamable"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "brief-prepare",
      "name": "Prepare Generation",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.mcpClient",
      "position": [
        320,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "tool": {
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "prepare_generation"
        },
        "inputMode": "json",
        "jsonInput": "={{ JSON.stringify($('Normalize Brief').item.json.generationRequest) }}",
        "endpointUrl": "https://api.maxvideoai.com/mcp",
        "authentication": "mcpOAuth2Api",
        "serverTransport": "httpStreamable"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "brief-approval",
      "name": "Human Approval",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "position": [
        700,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "unit": "days",
        "amount": 1,
        "resume": "webhook",
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "approvalRule": "Approve the exact fresh MaxVideoAI quote only"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.1
    },
    {
      "id": "brief-approval-check",
      "name": "Require Explicit Approval",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "position": [
        960,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "version": 2,
            "leftValue": "",
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "exact-approval",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true"
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body && $json.body.approved === true && $json.body.quoteId === $('Prepare Generation').item.json.structuredContent.quoteId }}",
              "rightValue": true
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.2
    },
    {
      "id": "brief-rejected",
      "name": "Approval Rejected",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "position": [
        1220,
        260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "outcome": "No generation was confirmed"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "brief-confirm",
      "name": "Confirm Generation",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.mcpClient",
      "position": [
        1560,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "tool": {
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "confirm_generation"
        },
        "inputMode": "json",
        "jsonInput": "={{ JSON.stringify({ quoteId: $('Prepare Generation').item.json.structuredContent.quoteId, confirmed: true }) }}",
        "endpointUrl": "https://api.maxvideoai.com/mcp",
        "authentication": "mcpOAuth2Api",
        "serverTransport": "httpStreamable"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "brief-poll-wait",
      "name": "Wait Before Status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "position": [
        2600,
        260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "unit": "seconds",
        "amount": "={{ $json.structuredContent.retry.afterSeconds }}",
        "resume": "timeInterval"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.1
    },
    {
      "id": "brief-status",
      "name": "Get Generation Status",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.mcpClient",
      "position": [
        2860,
        260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "tool": {
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "get_generation_status"
        },
        "inputMode": "json",
        "jsonInput": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.structuredContent.retry.parameters) }}",
        "endpointUrl": "https://api.maxvideoai.com/mcp",
        "authentication": "mcpOAuth2Api",
        "serverTransport": "httpStreamable"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "brief-terminal",
      "name": "Generation Terminal?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "position": [
        2080,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "version": 2,
            "leftValue": "",
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "combinator": "or",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "completed",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.structuredContent.status }}",
              "rightValue": "completed"
            },
            {
              "id": "failed",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.structuredContent.status }}",
              "rightValue": "failed"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.2
    },
    {
      "id": "brief-poll-limit",
      "name": "Continue Polling?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "position": [
        2340,
        260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "version": 2,
            "leftValue": "",
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "bounded-poll",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true"
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ Boolean($json.structuredContent && ['accepted', 'running'].includes($json.structuredContent.status) && $json.structuredContent.retry && $json.structuredContent.retry.tool === 'get_generation_status' && $json.structuredContent.retry.parameters && $json.structuredContent.retry.parameters.jobId === $('Confirm Generation').item.json.structuredContent.jobId && Number.isFinite($json.structuredContent.retry.afterSeconds) && $json.structuredContent.retry.afterSeconds > 0 && $runIndex < 20) }}",
              "rightValue": true
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.2
    },
    {
      "id": "brief-poll-timeout",
      "name": "Polling Timed Out",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "position": [
        2600,
        560
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "outcome": "Automatic recovery stopped: preserve the accepted jobId; no confirmation was repeated"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "brief-result",
      "name": "Present Result",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.mcpClient",
      "position": [
        3120,
        -20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "tool": {
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "present_generation"
        },
        "inputMode": "json",
        "jsonInput": "={{ JSON.stringify({ jobId: $('Confirm Generation').item.json.structuredContent.jobId }) }}",
        "endpointUrl": "https://api.maxvideoai.com/mcp",
        "authentication": "mcpOAuth2Api",
        "serverTransport": "httpStreamable"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "brief-retry-field-adapter",
      "name": "Normalize Retry Fields",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.renameKeys",
      "position": [
        1820,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "keys": {
          "key": [
            {
              "newKey": "structuredContent.retry.parameters",
              "currentKey": "structuredContent.retry.arguments"
            }
          ]
        },
        "additionalOptions": {}
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    }
  ],
